~ start
[wave amp=2 freq=2]I want to go home.[/wave]

RITCHIE: [speed=1.3]Hey!

RITCHIE: Ollie!

OLLIE: [speed=0.5]...Huh?[/speed]

RITCHIE: [speed=1.2]There you are! Why are you just standing there? I've been looking all over for you![/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]Ritchie...? You're... [wait=0.5]you're real?[/speed]

RITCHIE: Duh, of course it's me. Who else? Your imaginary friend? Or did you see a [wave amp=4 freq=5]ghost?[/wave]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Where did everyone go? We were just playing Langit Lupa a second ago... [wait=0.8]and then the sky went dark...[/speed]

RITCHIE: Huh? What are you talking about? The game ended like ten minutes ago!

RITCHIE: Everyone ran to the canteen to buy ice candy. The line was [wave amp=2 freq=2]suuuuuper[/wave] long so I came back to look for you.

RITCHIE: ...

RITCHIE: Hey, what's with that face?

RITCHIE: Don't tell me your tummy is hurting because of that whole bag of spicy chicharon I gave you earlier?

OLLIE: [shake rate=8 level=2]No, it's not![/shake]

RITCHIE: Really? Then why do you look like you're about to cry?

OLLIE: [shake rate=5 level=1]I'm NOT gonna cry![/shake]

RITCHIE: Uh-huh...[wave amp=2 freq=2]suuuure[/wave]. You looked like a deflated fishball when you ate that last piece!

OLLIE: [shake rate=12 level=3]HEY! That wasn't funny![/shake]

RITCHIE: [wave amp=4 freq=5]HEHEHE![/wave]

RITCHIE: ...

RITCHIE: [speed=0.8]Hey, Ollie. [wait=0.5]Seriously, are you okay?[/speed]

- I saw something else...
	OLLIE: [speed=0.7]It's just... [wait=0.5]didn't you see them, Ritchie?[/speed]
	OLLIE: [speed=1.2]Everything just STOPPED! The sky turned all black and that swing was moving by itself! And there was water EVERYWHERE! And—[/speed]
	RITCHIE: [speed=1.3]Whoa, whoa! Slow down! What swing? What water?[/speed]
	OLLIE: [shake rate=8 level=2]I-I saw it! I'm not making it up! I swear![/shake]
	RITCHIE: But there's nothing here! Look! Are you sure you didn't just have a weird dream while standing up?
	OLLIE: [speed=0.5]It wasn't a dream...[/speed]
	RITCHIE: Hmmm...
	RITCHIE: Well, your eyes are all watery. Maybe it's the chili powder from the chicharon after all?
	OLLIE: [shake rate=10 level=2]It's NOT the chili![/shake]

- Nevermind. It's just a headache.
	OLLIE: [speed=0.7]It's nothing. My head just hurts a little.[/speed]
	RITCHIE: From the Math quiz? Argh! Math always makes my brain explode too.
	RITCHIE: [wave amp=3 freq=4]Hehehe![/wave] Besides, your eyes are all watery. Must be the chili powder after all!
	OLLIE: [shake rate=10 level=2]It's NOT the chili![/shake]

RITCHIE: [speed=0.8]Okay, okay! Don't get mad![/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]Hmph![/speed]

RITCHIE: [speed=1.3]Oh, look! I still have two more packs![/speed]

OLLIE: [shake rate=12 level=3]WHAT?! You still have MORE?! And you didn't tell me![/shake]

RITCHIE: [wave amp=4 freq=4]Bleeeh![/wave] I bought 3 packs for ONLY P20 from Aling Nena earlier using my extra baon! Gave you only one pack.

OLLIE: [shake rate=8 level=2]Then WHY did you give me only one?![/shake]

RITCHIE: Because I bought them with MY money!

OLLIE: But I thought we shared EVERYTHING?!

RITCHIE: We do! Just... not ALL my chicharon!

OLLIE: [shake rate=5 level=2]Hmp! You're so stingy![/shake]

RITCHIE: Am not!

OLLIE: Stingy!

RITCHIE: Am NOT!

OLLIE: [speed=1.5]Stingy! Stingy! Stingy![/speed]

RITCHIE: [shake rate=10 level=3]HEY! Stop it![/shake] ...Anyway!

RITCHIE: [speed=0.8]Your birthday's on November 8, right?[/speed]

OLLIE: Yeah, I know. [speed=0.7]I'm old already.[/speed]

RITCHIE: [speed=1.3]OLD?! You're only turning eight![/speed]

OLLIE: Still older than I was yesterday!

RITCHIE: [wave amp=3 freq=4]HAHAHA![/wave] So, are you having a birthday party? Will there be spaghetti with hotdogs?

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]I dunno. Nanay hasn't told me yet. Maybe we'll just have a simple one. Or order Jabi again.[/speed]

RITCHIE: Huh? But it's your birthday! Don't you know what Nanay's planning?

- I don't want to ask.
	OLLIE: [speed=0.7]Parties cost a lot of money anyway. [wait=0.5]It's fine if we don't have one.[/speed]
	RITCHIE: Huh? But what about spaghetti and hotdogs?!
	OLLIE: [wave amp=2 freq=2]Hehe...[/wave] You just want the food!
	RITCHIE: Well... yeah, but birthdays are fun! And you're never too old for [wave amp=3 freq=3]balloons![/wave]

- I really want to have one... 
	OLLIE: [speed=0.6]...I actually drew my dream birthday party in my diary last night.[/speed]
	RITCHIE: [speed=1.3]You did?! What's in it?[/speed]
	OLLIE: [speed=0.9]A big chocolate cake! And lots of balloons... [wait=0.5]But don't tell Nanay! I hid the drawing![/speed]
	RITCHIE: [wave amp=3 freq=4]Hehehe![/wave] So you DO want a party!
	OLLIE: [shake rate=5 level=2]Shhh! Keep your voice down![/shake]

RITCHIE: [speed=1.1]Well, whatever happens, you HAVE to invite me, okay? I'm your best friend![/speed]

OLLIE: Of course! Obviously you're invited.

RITCHIE: [speed=0.8]Hmmm... but seriously, what do you really want for your birthday gift anyway?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]I dunno...[/speed]

RITCHIE: [shake rate=5 level=2]Huh?! How can you NOT know?![/shake]

OLLIE: I just don't!

RITCHIE: [speed=1.2]Fine! Then I'll pick something for you![/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.3]Really?! What is it?[/speed]

RITCHIE: [wave amp=3 freq=4]It's a secret! No clues![/wave]

OLLIE: [shake rate=5 level=2]Hey! That's unfair! Tell me![/shake]

RITCHIE: Nope! You'll just have to wait and see!

OLLIE: [shake rate=5 level=2]Ritchie![/shake]

#BELL RINGS

RITCHIE: [speed=1.5][shake rate=8 level=3]OH NO! THE BELL! We're gonna be late! Ma'am Santos is gonna get us![/shake]

OLLIE: [speed=1.3]Hey! Wait for me![/speed]
=> END